          <div class="px-5 pb-4 pt-1 border-t border-chill-border bg-chill-surface">
            <p class="text-micro text-chill-text-secondary leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">The following limitations are documented for transparency.

The entered PIN passes through memory as a Dart String (immutable), persisting a few milliseconds until garbage collection. Very low impact.

The PIN hash and salt are stored in SharedPreferences (unencrypted). Mitigated by PBKDF2 making offline brute force impractical.

The Process.run timeout does not guarantee child process termination (Dart limitation). Documented, future improvement planned.

TOCTOU on temporary scripts: a local process could theoretically modify the script between creation and execution. Mitigated by 700 permissions.

The Tailscale daemon binary may be resolved via the system PATH as fallback. A warning is logged.</p>
